	(text "DESIGN NOTES - ANALOGUE OUTPUT ONLY\nNominal 3rd-order Butterworth: ~39.9 kHz; ~2.01 V RMS unloaded at 1 kHz.\nR60/R61 and filter resistors: thin-film 0.1%. Filter capacitors: C0G 1%, >=25 V.\nDC coupled: measure output offset before connecting the LM4562/PGA2310 preamp.\nInitial I/V compensation assumes unknown DAC/PCB capacitance; bench verification required.\nDAC support added separately. Hardware output muting and bench validation remain outstanding."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 289.56 360.68 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0fbfc47e-466f-40ca-9899-eb57f792fc1e")
	)
	(text "U6 exposed pad 13 = IN (-8V), never GND."
