	(text "C20/C21: >=4.7uF EFFECTIVE at +5V. C29: >=10uF EFFECTIVE at -5V.\nVerify selected ceramic DC-bias curves, ESR and package before ordering.\n49k9 x 100uA = +/-4.99V. CSET=4.7uF: tau~235ms; fast start disabled.\nEN and PGFB to IN; ILIM to GND are intentional. PG and VIOC unused."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 365 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
