	(text "PREREGULATORS: 110R / 590R => approximately +/-8V.\nDivider current ~11.4mA maintains regulation with downstream rails off.\nD1/D3: OUT-IN discharge protection; D2/D4: ADJ capacitor protection.\nTO-220 tabs differ: U12 = OUT (+8V), U10 = IN (-15V).\nDo not bolt bare tabs to the same heatsink or grounded metal."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 175.26 375.92 0)
		(effects
